Add a Remote Query producer to the Postgres integration: resolve database_instance and tuple targets inside the check's effective monitoring scope (configured database plus autodiscovery) with a side-effect-free per-check resolve verdict, execute the strictly validated query exactly once in a read-only transaction whose statement timeout the remote_queries.timeout_ms instance option may only shorten, and stream the result as native COPY CSV pages directly to its-agent-intake per page, with array element delimiters resolved from catalog metadata.